W44-AUDIT-7 — Wider-Corpus cjxl-Parity Bench (Phase 1)
========================================================

Date:      2026-05-24
Author:    Claude session (claude-w44-audit-7)
Encoder:   commit fbd31e04 (parent of bench commit; bench is measurement-only)
Reference: cjxl v0.12.0 4279d48 [_AVX3_,AVX2,SSE4,SSE2] (libjxl @ master)

Tooling:
  cargo run -p jxl-encoder --release \
    --features "parallel butteraugli-loop ssim2-loop __expert" \
    --example w44_audit_7_wider_corpus -- \
    --output benchmarks/w44_audit_7_wider_corpus_2026-05-24.tsv

  Decoder for both cjxl and zenjxl scoring: jxl-oxide 0.13 (via repo workspace
  pin to imazen/jxl-oxide@fd4e2c3, requested in srgb_linear color encoding).
  Butteraugli: in-process Rust crate (ButteraugliParams::default()).
  SSIMULACRA2: in-process Rust crate (fast_ssim2 0.x).
  M3-colourfulness: replicated Hasler-Süsstrunk 2003 over sRGB u8 (matches
  zenanalyze::tier1 bit-for-bit).

